# Shared look for every recording. Sourced, not copied, so they cannot drift apart.
#
# Height is deliberately *not* set here: each recording sizes itself to what its command prints,
# which is the point of having one file per feature rather than one long film.

Require pixi-sbom

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1240
Set Padding 16
Set Margin 10
Set BorderRadius 8
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 30
Set TypingSpeed 28ms
Set Framerate 24
